## ✅ Example Tasks for Cursor AI

- ✅ Scaffold application factory and register all Blueprints.
- ✅ Create models, schemas, and database migrations.
- ✅ Implement authentication with JWT + PGP 2FA + CAPTCHA.
- ✅ Set up encrypted messaging with auto-deletion.
- ✅ Build secure listing management and vendor workflows.
- ✅ Add Monero + Bitcoin escrow logic with multisig.
- ✅ Configure background jobs with `apscheduler`.
